Monkey chiefs guard Rāma in armed ranks --- Rāvaṇa summons Trijaṭā and rākṣasīs --- Rāvaṇa orders Sītā shown slain brothers --- Rākṣasīs bring Sītā to Puṣpaka --- Rāvaṇa decks Laṅkā and proclaims victory --- Sītā sees stricken monkeys and exulting rākṣasas --- Sītā sees brothers arrow-pierced on ground --- Sītā laments judging brothers dead